{"src":"uk","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":181600,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"uk","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":6438.042768,"text":"Однак Шенгенська зона у цьому розумінні діє ніби одна країна."},{"kind":"text","t":7033.737426000001,"text":"However, the Schengen Area functions as if it were one country in this sense."},{"kind":"audio","t":7127.161272,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7131.624881000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":7136.870698,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7140.903714000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":7141.5925130000005,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":15598.862437,"text":"Печера розташована на верхівці однієї з гір, на північ від Мекки, і повністю ізольована від решти світу."},{"kind":"text","t":16467.652517000002,"text":"The cave is located on the summit of one of the mountains north of Mecca and is completely isolated from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"audio","t":16569.232213,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16570.770429,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16572.179376,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16573.570884,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16575.266407000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16576.749214,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":900},{"kind":"audio","t":16577.036339000002,"samples":3192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":23855.545757,"text":"Люди тепер пишуть повідомлення на екрані комп'ютера, не маючи жодної необхідності набажати до струхачки."},{"kind":"text","t":24443.055635,"text":"People now type messages on their computer screens without any need to reach for a keyboard."},{"kind":"audio","t":24534.939885,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24540.389599000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24545.393439,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24550.842973000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24554.391746,"samples":25528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":36367.620534,"text":"Мандрівники, які подорожують до країн з високими податками, іноді можуть заощадити значну суму грошей, особливо на таких товарах, як алкогольні напої та тютюн."},{"kind":"text","t":37257.402131,"text":"Travelers going to countries with high taxes can sometimes save a significant amount of money, especially on goods such as alcoholic drinks and tobacco."},{"kind":"audio","t":37363.578514,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":37368.88846,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":37374.149626,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":37379.569240000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":37384.998494,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":37390.525056,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":37395.034145,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":37398.337102,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":840},{"kind":"audio","t":37398.663857,"samples":3056,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":43252.845029000004,"text":"Рослини готують їжу з сонця за допомогою фотосинтезу. Вони також забезпечують тінь."},{"kind":"text","t":43723.68996,"text":"Plants prepare food from sunlight through photosynthesis. They also provide shade."},{"kind":"audio","t":43810.219635,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43815.422243,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43820.884536,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":880},{"kind":"audio","t":43821.068273000004,"samples":1896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":43905.527641,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43908.342877,"samples":22432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":390},{"kind":"input","t":54132.284599,"text":"Лікарня дотримувалася протоколу інфекційного контролю, включаючи відокремлення пацієнта від інших для запобігання можливої їх зараження."},{"kind":"text","t":54791.633196,"text":"The hospital followed infection control protocols, including isolating the patient from others to prevent possible contamination."},{"kind":"audio","t":54894.169877,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54897.466665,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54900.92709,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54904.257307,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54907.569225,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54910.879182000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54913.682298,"samples":29592,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":64529.340402,"text":"Виконана робота була в основному теоретичною, але програма була створена, щоб симулювати спостереження за галактикою у стрільці."},{"kind":"text","t":65325.85772,"text":"The work done was primarily theoretical, but the program was created to simulate the observation of the Sagittarius galaxy."},{"kind":"audio","t":65424.744879000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":65431.207326,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":65437.553845999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":65445.06557600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":65451.53507300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":65456.041142,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":65457.684146,"samples":16992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":70},{"kind":"input","t":77328.863713,"text":"Офіційні мови Барселони – це каталонська та іспанська. Майже половина віддає перевагу розмовам каталонською. Переважна більшість розуміє її і майже всі знають іспанську."},{"kind":"text","t":77932.417896,"text":"The official languages of Barcelona are Catalan and Spanish. Almost half prefer to speak in Catalan. The vast majority understand her, and almost everyone speaks Spanish."},{"kind":"audio","t":78020.851091,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78026.069908,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":78031.500392,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78033.892254,"samples":19296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"audio","t":78104.634191,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78109.949466,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":78111.039679,"samples":12464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":78195.788703,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78201.147968,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78206.528732,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78210.651687,"samples":28296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":630},{"kind":"input","t":83166.48596800001,"text":"В деяких місцях достатньо кип'ятити воду хвилину, в інших треба кілька хвилин."},{"kind":"text","t":83823.518391,"text":"In some places, boiling water is sufficient for a minute, while in others it takes several minutes."},{"kind":"audio","t":83913.522382,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83918.752189,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83924.281911,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":83929.54414700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83935.347215,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":950},{"kind":"audio","t":83935.781768,"samples":2960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":91503.64408,"text":"Рослини найкраще виглядають в природному середовищі, тому чиніть опір, спокусість знищити навіть сьогодніний екземпляр."},{"kind":"text","t":92195.794876,"text":"Plants look best in their natural environment, so resist the temptation to destroy even today’s specimen."},{"kind":"audio","t":92299.42421,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92304.633547,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":92309.690896,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92315.14522,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92320.429676,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92323.977599,"samples":24560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":100298.243075,"text":"Протягом 1920-х років переважними настроями більшості громадян і націй були пацифізм та ізоляція."},{"kind":"text","t":101121.130894,"text":"During the 1920s, pacifism and isolationism were the dominant attitudes among most citizens and nations."},{"kind":"audio","t":101218.081504,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101223.535318,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101228.978801,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101234.12102,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101239.384486,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101244.536274,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":101245.657746,"samples":12192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":108855.123007,"text":"Мосозавр був хижаком вищого порядку свого часу, тому він нічого не боявся, окрім інших мосозаврів."},{"kind":"text","t":109594.250497,"text":"Mosasaurus was a top predator of its time, so it feared nothing except other Mosasaurs."},{"kind":"audio","t":109684.299066,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109689.619272,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":109694.738301,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109700.165384,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109705.319992,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":860},{"kind":"audio","t":109705.48307,"samples":1760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":120259.776365,"text":"З моменту заснування Асунсьйона в 1537 році Парагваю вдалося зберегти значну частину своїх корінних ознак і самобутності."},{"kind":"text","t":121237.606493,"text":"Since the founding of Asunción in 1537, Paraguay has managed to preserve a significant portion of its indigenous characteristics and identity."},{"kind":"audio","t":121349.20956,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121354.303909,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121359.53591600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":121364.94699,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121370.490052,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121375.872606,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":121380.340196,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121383.555074,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":121384.145285,"samples":14456,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":126188.823847,"text":"Хвороба переноситься свинями, а потім через комарів передається до людей."},{"kind":"text","t":126704.769132,"text":"The disease is transmitted by pigs and then spreads to humans through mosquitoes."},{"kind":"audio","t":126802.026947,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":126807.107196,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":126812.600179,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":126817.830566,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":126818.22632,"samples":8128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":137389.873549,"text":"Більшість сучасних телескопів для наукових досліджень – це величезні об'єкти у віддаваних районах із приятелем атмосферними умовами."},{"kind":"text","t":138016.766211,"text":"Most modern telescopes for scientific research are enormous facilities located in areas with favorable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"audio","t":138115.941696,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138121.116924,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":138126.39262,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138132.545302,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138137.686461,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138143.163934,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138148.23575300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"audio","t":138148.577818,"samples":3424,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":147771.27895,"text":"Люди можуть не очікувати того, що терпіння та розуміння так само необхідні мандрівникам під час повернення додому."},{"kind":"text","t":148432.210982,"text":"People may not expect that patience and understanding are just as necessary for travelers on their way home."},{"kind":"audio","t":148531.15919,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":148536.22013,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148541.184201,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148546.820451,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148552.10765700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":148554.057756,"samples":16160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":153449.133862,"text":"Таким чином цілком імовірно, що запис було додано просто в якості мітки."},{"kind":"text","t":154015.508386,"text":"Thus, it’s quite likely that the entry was added merely as a label."},{"kind":"audio","t":154102.815009,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154105.726123,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154109.234097,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154113.252914,"samples":26496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":159028.494899,"text":"Але птахи все ще мають багато чого від динозаврів."},{"kind":"text","t":159433.128412,"text":"But birds still have a lot in common with dinosaurs."},{"kind":"audio","t":159522.102749,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":159527.501063,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159531.561759,"samples":29264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"input","t":171888.672537,"text":"Практично всі вони представляють собою піщані пляжі, які є безпечними для плавання, і більшість з них затінені деревами по хоту кава."},{"kind":"text","t":172663.49018,"text":"Almost all of them are sandy beaches that are safe for swimming, and most of them are shaded by trees along the shore."},{"kind":"audio","t":172763.545671,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":172768.959405,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":172773.928426,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":172779.152243,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":172784.527708,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":172788.726141,"samples":29360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":178478.83877,"text":"Дюваль, який одружений і має двох дорослих дітей, не справа великого враження на Міллера."},{"kind":"text","t":179197.245739,"text":"Duvall, who is married and has two adult children, didn’t make a big impression on Miller."},{"kind":"audio","t":179290.150048,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179295.566341,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179300.587691,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"audio","t":179305.984394,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179309.664365,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"input","t":181355.801915,"text":"з яким ця історія була пов'язана."},{"kind":"text","t":181649.870205,"text":"which this story was related to."},{"kind":"audio","t":181734.999309,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":181739.034684,"samples":30232,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":700},{"kind":"close","t":191804.641674,"code":1005}]}